        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 2205, #8 Brass 1-7/8 inch x 5 inch Flush Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Small Empire Arch Flush Pull is transitional in design --straddling the line between classic and modern in a way that is stunning and timeless. The #8 Brass 1-7/8 inch x 5 inch Flush Pull is available in a wide array of finish color options. The Emtek 2205 Pocket Door Flush Pull is recessed into the door with a 1/8 inch projection for a seamless look once installed.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-2205-specifications.gif?v=1704354669 \"width=\"517\" height=\"330\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Emtek 2205 Flush Pull Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/large-empire-arch-flush-pull-emtek-2206\"><b>Large Empire Arch Flush Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Emtek 2205 Pocket Door Flush Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Overall Height: 4-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Width: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Depth: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Cut-Out Height: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Cut-Out Width: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with matching finish brad nails.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-2205-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262426\" target=\"new\"><b>Emtek 2205 Dimensions  Diagram (PDF)</a></b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
