                "title": "Small Empire Arch Flush Pull",
                "description": "The Small Empire Arch Flush Pull is transitional in design --straddling the line between classic and modern in a way that is stunning and timeless. The #8 Brass 1-7/8 inch x 5 inch Flush Pull is available in a wide array of finish color options. The Emtek 2205 Pocket Door Flush Pull is recessed into the door with a 1/8 inch projection for a seamless look once installed.",
